        "id": 106876,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-23T17:54:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well, given the Kickstarter had an estimated delivery by December, it doesn't seem likely, but who knows. I'm not sure where that blurb came from, though. Could it just be someone's wishful thinking?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I could see a situation where they have a couple of copies of the Core base set, sans minis, sans Uprising. I would be way more than surprised if that was the case, but there could be an offchance it happens.</p>",
